WEBVTT

00:08.640 --> 00:13.640
Princess Resurrection

00:20.880 --> 00:26.860
If I was dreaming, how did I forget?

00:26.920 --> 00:30.690
It pulsed through me, frigid, shocked me

00:30.690 --> 00:32.330
Can I do, do?

00:33.000 --> 00:38.000
I want you next to me when I summon you

00:39.170 --> 00:43.000
Waiting close by, but you seem far off

00:43.010 --> 00:45.340
Na, na, na, knight

00:45.340 --> 00:48.510
The more beautiful the rose

00:48.510 --> 00:51.480
The more its thorns hurt

00:51.480 --> 00:54.750
Now that I'm strong

00:54.750 --> 00:59.750
My heart knows to protect that vow

01:00.760 --> 01:03.790
Let's meet in the dark of night

01:03.790 --> 01:06.860
Where you're waiting

01:06.860 --> 01:09.860
You'll worship the cruel Dark Queen

01:09.870 --> 01:13.030
Who's drunk with danger

01:13.040 --> 01:16.000
You shattered the glass sword

01:16.000 --> 01:18.970
You wielded without thinking

01:18.970 --> 01:21.910
Its shards glow in the night

01:21.910 --> 01:25.380
I lick your wounded fingers

01:54.840 --> 01:56.690
I've got a strange feeling about this place.

02:05.320 --> 02:06.960
Huh?

02:17.730 --> 02:21.770
That's strange, my sister said in her
letter that this was the place.

02:22.600 --> 02:24.410
How are you doing, Hiro?

02:24.410 --> 02:28.610
I know we've been apart ever since
our parents passed away,

02:28.610 --> 02:33.610
but I finally found a job as a maid in a
mansion where we can live together.

02:35.480 --> 02:38.690
Please move as soon as you can.
I'll be waiting.

02:40.460 --> 02:42.700
I'm sure this is the place, but...

02:52.800 --> 02:55.910
What's going on? Why isn't she here?

03:03.880 --> 03:05.860
Maybe I should ask someone.

03:06.420 --> 03:08.120
Excuse me...

03:18.230 --> 03:20.140
Wh..What?

03:27.500 --> 03:31.810
I don't feel very welcome in this town.

03:35.780 --> 03:37.420
Master!

03:38.380 --> 03:40.950
Another parfait, please.

03:41.350 --> 03:44.820
Welcome to Sssanaki Town Shopping District!

04:07.780 --> 04:09.920
What an unimpressive town.

04:20.220 --> 04:21.590
No good?

04:21.590 --> 04:23.230
Hug;-a?

04:59.860 --> 05:01.500
Huga...

05:01.960 --> 05:03.840
What's with that guy?

05:04.530 --> 05:07.540
This is horrible!
This kid's been crushed!

05:07.540 --> 05:09.800
An ambulance!
Someone call an ambulance!

05:09.810 --> 05:11.880
Hurry, we have to do something!

05:16.410 --> 05:20.790
Being crushed because you tried
to save me, how foolish.

05:23.420 --> 05:26.700
So, you're not hurt.
I'm so glad...

05:29.690 --> 05:31.500
Are you all right?

05:40.670 --> 05:42.510
What a nice corpse.

05:45.010 --> 05:47.990
General Hospital

05:49.380 --> 05:49.980
Operating

06:00.190 --> 06:02.000
It's no use.

06:09.830 --> 06:15.300
Oh yeah, my little brother comes to town today.

06:20.080 --> 06:22.640
Have you contacted the next of kin?

06:22.640 --> 06:24.280
No...

06:26.680 --> 06:30.290
I see, what a shame, he was so young.

06:31.120 --> 06:32.930
Yes, sir.

06:51.740 --> 06:53.520
Ouch...

06:54.810 --> 07:00.090
All right, this mansion sure could
use some cleaning.

07:00.920 --> 07:04.080
Though, come to think of it, Hiro's really late.

07:04.090 --> 07:06.450
I wonder if he's lost?

07:06.450 --> 07:08.090
Huh?

07:09.460 --> 07:11.790
Oh, so you're Flandre.

07:11.790 --> 07:14.160
I look forward to working with you, Flan

07:14.160 --> 07:15.160
Huga.

07:15.160 --> 07:19.130
You pulled this here all by yourself?
That must have been tough.

07:19.130 --> 07:20.770
Huga?

07:21.570 --> 07:23.450
Where is the Mistress?

07:23.870 --> 07:25.510
Huga!

07:28.780 --> 07:33.780
General Hospital

07:33.780 --> 07:37.750
Morgue

07:51.630 --> 07:54.970
That is not dead which can eternal lie.

07:54.970 --> 07:58.250
And with strange eons even death may die.

08:05.910 --> 08:08.050
I bestow upon you the flame of life.

08:08.820 --> 08:12.460
Oh flame, fill his body with life anew.

08:52.590 --> 08:55.510
Welcome home. You must be the Mistress, right?

08:56.300 --> 09:01.040
I will be in your care from now on.
I'm your new maid, Sawawa Hiyorimi.

09:03.070 --> 09:07.540
Where have you been, ma'am?
Flan was worried about you.

09:07.540 --> 09:09.180
Huga.

09:10.010 --> 09:12.250
This is the mansion?

09:12.250 --> 09:13.980
It's pl-I "Y

09:13.980 --> 09:15.520
Pardon?

09:15.520 --> 09:21.020
It's quite large! What son of house did
you used to live in, Mistress?

09:22.090 --> 09:23.290
Huga, huga?

09:23.290 --> 09:25.070
Right, good point.

09:26.830 --> 09:28.360
Huga.

09:28.360 --> 09:33.360
The Mistress is incredible!
She can even understand Flan's words.

09:33.640 --> 09:35.270
Sawawa...

09:35.670 --> 09:37.480
It's dinnertime

09:37.940 --> 09:39.890
Certainly, I'll be right there.

09:41.640 --> 09:46.220
My, Hiro must be taking his
sweet time somewhere.

09:47.020 --> 09:49.480
Keep this between me and you,

09:49.480 --> 09:52.950
doesn't it seem like there's a lot of
strange activity in this hospital?

09:52.950 --> 09:54.490
Strange activity?

09:54.490 --> 09:56.800
Like, take the Chief, for example...

09:57.630 --> 09:59.260
Did you hear something?

09:59.260 --> 10:00.590
What?

10:00.600 --> 10:02.230
I didn't hear anything.

10:02.530 --> 10:04.260
But it came from there.

10:04.270 --> 10:07.370
Relax, it was just your imagination.

10:07.370 --> 10:10.250
Yeah, I bet you're right.

10:29.790 --> 10:31.430
Huh?

10:39.130 --> 10:40.940
Where am I?

10:46.610 --> 10:48.420
Excuse me...

10:53.680 --> 10:56.820
What? A cadaver escaped?

10:58.620 --> 11:00.290
Yes, sir.

11:00.290 --> 11:02.560
A cadaver is escaping! A cadaver is escaping!

11:03.730 --> 11:05.300
Cadaver?

11:06.760 --> 11:08.400
Me?

11:08.700 --> 11:12.300
Relax... My sister invited me here,
and then I went to that mansion...

11:12.830 --> 11:17.270
Right, the mansion was abandoned and
my sister wasn't there, and then...

11:17.270 --> 11:19.080
And then...

11:36.360 --> 11:38.170
That's right.

11:41.530 --> 11:43.170
L...

11:45.100 --> 11:46.910
What a nice corpse.

11:56.540 --> 11:59.150
The lights are on in the mansion!

12:12.790 --> 12:14.900
Was the food to your liking?

12:14.900 --> 12:15.960
Yes...

12:15.960 --> 12:18.950
I'm very grateful, Mistress.

12:19.870 --> 12:24.270
Allowing my brother and I to stay
with you is such a kind deed.

12:24.270 --> 12:27.410
I will introduce him to you as soon as he arrives.

12:27.410 --> 12:29.010
Don't bother.

12:29.010 --> 12:33.080
Though you're a human,
you don't waste time on frivolities.

12:33.650 --> 12:35.680
Let's keep things as they are.

12:35.680 --> 12:36.680
Yes, ma'am.

12:36.680 --> 12:38.490
Please excuse me.

12:39.220 --> 12:41.720
Goodnight, Flan.

12:41.720 --> 12:43.360
Huga.

12:50.470 --> 12:52.270
Huga, huga.

12:52.500 --> 12:55.110
Yes, it's about that time.

12:55.540 --> 12:56.640
Huga?

12:56.640 --> 12:58.450
A Pact?

12:59.440 --> 13:02.890
Don't group me in with the vampires.

13:03.440 --> 13:07.950
However desperate for subjects I may be,
I'd never sink to that level.

13:07.950 --> 13:12.330
Do you think a king enters into
pacts with his subjects?

13:12.750 --> 13:14.390
Huga?

13:14.390 --> 13:15.860
Right?

13:15.860 --> 13:20.860
Those who are graced by my nourishing drops
of life should at least have proper lineage

13:22.000 --> 13:24.530
or some sort of achievement under their belt.

13:24.530 --> 13:28.810
But for a boy who rushed under some
beams and died? Unthinkable.

13:29.570 --> 13:32.210
I need to get to that mansion.

13:39.450 --> 13:40.510
Huga?

13:40.520 --> 13:42.320
So why?

13:43.250 --> 13:44.890
Right.

13:45.950 --> 13:48.900
Because I'm merciful.

13:52.230 --> 13:56.230
I should have expected as much,
but they have a moon here too.

14:06.140 --> 14:07.950
What's going on?

14:12.080 --> 14:13.680
Follow me, Flandre!

14:13.680 --> 14:15.720
Huga... Huga!

14:21.960 --> 14:24.020
I know dogs have a strong sense of hearing,

14:24.030 --> 14:26.230
but he made it here rather quickly.

14:37.940 --> 14:40.750
Looks like he brought the whole pack tonight.

14:45.680 --> 14:47.660
Is that you, Wildman?

14:50.890 --> 14:54.890
Now, I know this dog isn't baring
his fangs at his master.

14:54.890 --> 14:57.460
Are you working for my brother?

15:00.560 --> 15:02.200
Mistress Hime...

15:08.500 --> 15:10.140
Huga!

15:22.750 --> 15:24.560
An android?

15:25.150 --> 15:28.190
Attacking the little one is pointless.

15:28.190 --> 15:30.570
Get past her and aim for Mistress Hime!

15:39.270 --> 15:41.600
Hit me if you can.

15:41.600 --> 15:44.810
Flandre and I are untouchable.

15:47.010 --> 15:48.650
Go!

15:53.610 --> 15:57.530
This place was vacant earlier today.

15:59.020 --> 16:00.830
What's that?

16:12.800 --> 16:14.200
Huga?

16:14.200 --> 16:18.410
Worry not, Flandre, they pose no threat to us.

16:19.110 --> 16:23.080
And anyway, I'm displeased with you, Wildman.

16:23.080 --> 16:25.680
You won't fight me directly!

16:26.110 --> 16:32.660
Is it that you won't lay a hand on me
because I'm your former master?

16:33.220 --> 16:36.930
Or are you taking pity on me because
I'm a weak little girl?

16:37.290 --> 16:39.730
Answer me, Wildman!

16:39.730 --> 16:43.230
You've dishonored your claws and fangs!

16:44.770 --> 16:46.570
Yo u-r e wrong'

16:47.500 --> 16:51.740
Wh..What the heck?!

16:51.740 --> 16:53.950
Now that you've lost your honor,

16:54.410 --> 16:56.220
you're just another beast!

16:57.610 --> 17:01.480
What's going on? Who is that huge guy?

17:01.480 --> 17:04.250
And why is that girl wielding a sword?!

17:04.250 --> 17:06.230
What the heck's going on?!

17:07.760 --> 17:09.960
Though you may have been my master,

17:09.960 --> 17:12.730
I will not listen to you insult me like this!

17:14.430 --> 17:19.000
I'll use my claws to regain my honor
and send you straight to Hell!

17:21.300 --> 17:22.500
This is bad.

17:22.500 --> 17:24.340
If this goes on, that girl will...

17:24.340 --> 17:25.870
I have to do something.

17:25.870 --> 17:27.680
Wait... Me?

17:28.640 --> 17:30.350
Did I really just think that?

17:32.780 --> 17:34.880
I have no use for weaklings!

17:34.880 --> 17:36.520
Huga!

17:41.860 --> 17:44.170
Mistress Hime!

17:47.860 --> 17:49.540
What?

17:50.060 --> 17:52.570
Now you show up.

17:53.100 --> 17:54.740
Huga?

17:56.640 --> 17:58.550
Hurry and escape.

17:59.910 --> 18:01.720
A damn human?

18:05.210 --> 18:06.680
Mistress Hime!

18:06.680 --> 18:07.080
Huga.

18:08.380 --> 18:10.160
Damn!

18:30.100 --> 18:32.810
Don't belittle me, Wildman.

18:33.410 --> 18:35.850
Your family has been taken hostage.

18:36.310 --> 18:38.620
Or if not, they're about to be.

18:39.280 --> 18:45.230
Mistress Hime, forgive my disrespect please.

18:48.420 --> 18:49.660
Huga?

18:49.660 --> 18:51.120
Out of the question.

18:51.130 --> 18:53.990
Reviving someone you've killed yourself

18:54.000 --> 18:56.310
is firmly forbidden by law.

18:56.560 --> 18:59.970
Furthermore, this man knows
he's disgraced himself.

18:59.970 --> 19:03.640
If we revived him, he'd opt for suicide.

19:04.170 --> 19:05.810
Huga.

19:12.180 --> 19:13.890
How does it feel?

19:16.720 --> 19:19.430
How does it feel to die twice in one day?

19:21.290 --> 19:23.270
I can't tell.

19:26.860 --> 19:30.930
I was rushing in before I knew what happened.

19:30.930 --> 19:35.570
It was almost as if... I became a different person.

19:36.740 --> 19:38.380
But...

19:38.640 --> 19:42.240
I'm glad that you're safe.

19:42.240 --> 19:44.150
You're lucky.

19:52.050 --> 19:55.520
You have the potential to make a great servant.

19:55.520 --> 19:57.160
What?

19:57.160 --> 19:58.970
Don't you get it?!

19:59.790 --> 20:01.730
You're something else.

20:01.730 --> 20:04.270
I was the one who brought you back to life

20:04.930 --> 20:07.000
after you died under those steel beams.

20:09.100 --> 20:12.810
Well, it doesn't matter.
I'm putting this in you now.

20:16.480 --> 20:18.290
Listen closely.

20:19.580 --> 20:21.720
My name is Hime.

20:22.120 --> 20:23.680
Hime?

20:23.680 --> 20:25.320
Yes.

20:26.190 --> 20:31.190
I'm the daughter of the King who rules
over all the abnormal creatures

20:31.460 --> 20:33.340
that you call monsters.

20:36.260 --> 20:38.730
My people also possess the flame of life,

20:38.730 --> 20:42.840
which has the ability to grant
half-immortality to the dead.

20:43.370 --> 20:46.940
However, once its effect wears off,
you'll die in a matter of days.

20:48.880 --> 20:51.720
So, it would be advisable to serve me steadfastly.

20:52.650 --> 20:54.280
Forever.

20:59.750 --> 21:01.730
What?!

21:05.160 --> 21:08.270
You're so loud, Hiro.

21:17.610 --> 21:19.810
What's taking you so long?

21:19.810 --> 21:23.720
What if it were to start raining before
you finished fixing the roof?

21:27.950 --> 21:33.360
Hiro, please stop screaming
and help with the chores.

21:34.020 --> 21:35.900
You're a guy, aren't you?

21:37.120 --> 21:40.230
Flan, can you help me plant these flowers?

21:40.230 --> 21:41.870
Huga!

21:46.270 --> 21:50.240
What's going to happen to me now?

21:50.240 --> 21:52.710
Come on, Hiro.
Are you reflecting, or something?

21:52.710 --> 21:54.070
S..Sorry!

21:54.080 --> 21:56.810
That's right, Hiro, put your back into it.

21:56.810 --> 21:57.980
Put your back into it!

21:57.980 --> 21:58.710
Huga!

21:58.710 --> 21:59.880
Even Flandre is giving me orders.

21:59.880 --> 22:02.380
Hiro, stop screwing around and get to work.

22:02.380 --> 22:03.450
I'm not screwing around...

22:03.450 --> 22:05.290
Your back, put your back into it!

22:10.790 --> 22:15.790
Get down on your knees and lick my red nails

22:16.360 --> 22:24.310
Call me queen with your entangled tongue

22:26.870 --> 22:29.640
The sun that blooms in Hell

22:29.640 --> 22:32.380
Darkness that's fallen to Paradise

22:32.380 --> 22:34.950
If you're confronted with light and despair

22:34.950 --> 22:37.580
Which one goes deeper?

22:37.590 --> 22:40.320
Roses fly from my head

22:40.320 --> 22:43.020
I'll scatter them into Nirvana

22:43.020 --> 22:45.630
Wounds that secretly pain you

22:45.630 --> 22:48.200
Blood that gushes away

22:48.260 --> 22:50.900
They both lead to the depths of my heart

22:50.900 --> 22:53.570
You've given these gorgeous gifts as tribute

22:53.570 --> 22:56.240
And yet you're still

22:56.240 --> 22:58.940
Seeking love?

22:58.940 --> 23:01.670
Tell me exactly to what extent

23:01.680 --> 23:04.340
Grown men are just foolish little boys?

23:04.350 --> 23:09.350
Get down on your knees and lick my sacred feet

23:09.620 --> 23:14.620
Call me queen in your hoarse voice

23:15.060 --> 23:20.060
The proof of your life creeps up the tower of pain

23:20.290 --> 23:23.000
Slowly making your way, you can barely breathe

23:23.000 --> 23:25.630
But if you still ask for it

23:25.630 --> 23:29.600
Your dying breath just might be

23:29.600 --> 23:37.890
The words that melt my frozen tears

23:39.650 --> 23:40.650
Huga.

23:40.650 --> 23:43.650
Huh? I closed the window, but it's open.

23:43.650 --> 23:45.850
There are no snacks that I'd ever want to eat.

23:45.850 --> 23:46.920
Flandre...

23:46.920 --> 23:47.720
Huga?

23:47.720 --> 23:49.530
Or not.

23:49.620 --> 23:52.060
Who just tripped me?!

23:52.060 --> 23:54.960
Who just hit me?!

23:54.960 --> 23:57.100
What are you making all that racket for, Hiro?

23:57.100 --> 23:57.800
Hime...

23:57.800 --> 23:58.970
Huga.

23:58.970 --> 24:00.700
An invisible man, huh?

24:00.700 --> 24:02.940
Next episode, "Princess Destruction"

24:02.940 --> 24:04.600
Hime, how do we defeat someone we can't see?

24:06.070 --> 24:07.410
Huga, huga.
